{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>意大利全國逾六千間公立學校，收到炸彈威脅電郵，其中逾三百間需要疏散。</p><p></p><p>在首都羅馬一間中學，大批學生疏散至校園外。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ITA.THREAT-2330_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HgaKKSdhyV1794412196.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>當地傳媒報道，多間學校周三收到同一封以俄文名稱署名的電郵，稱在學園內放置了強力爆炸物，還稱在總理梅洛尼座駕引擎內放了炸彈。歐洲上周多間電視台受炸彈威脅，電郵亦以同一個俄文名稱署名。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ITA.THREAT-2330_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026i17ZJ7IEnJ1794412214.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>梅洛尼發聲明指，沒有跡象顯示學校有危險，相關威脅只是製造恐慌和擔憂，當局正調查事件。愛爾蘭、蘇格蘭和北愛爾蘭的學校，亦收到類似郵件，但無須疏散學生。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:01:44.833170+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:18:14.408928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:54:59.418935+00:00","content_hash":"e76d49a6279449caa599457247515a54e35eaa0bbf97fe9a56548bf79c487060","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:01:44.833170+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}